    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d360-a4">

                <pb facs="0731" n="621" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg621"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No.
                    179.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mariscal to Mr. Whitehouse.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-11-25"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 25,
                        1889</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Unofficial.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Whitehouse</hi>: I have the honor to answer
                    your note of the 22d instant, relative to the suspension of loading of the
                    schooner <hi rendition="#italic">Robert Ruff</hi> by the authorities at
                    Minatitlan, advising you that I have requested the secretary of treasury to try
                    and have the trial over as soon as possible, justly and without causing any
                    unnecessary delays.</p>
                <p>I remain, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
